a\\u0142y, gdy\\u017c wykonanie ich jest tak perfekcyjne, \\u017ce wr\\u0119cz niezgodne z prawami fizyki. St\\u0105d te\\u017c przypuszczenia o ich pozaziemskim pochodzeniu.&lt;\\\/span&gt;&lt;\\\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;description_short&quot;:&quot;&lt;p style=\\&quot;margin:0cm 0cm 10pt;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=\\&quot;line-height:115%;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;, serif;font-size:12pt;\\&quot;&gt;Butelka w kszta\\u0142cie czaszki zaprojektowana zosta\\u0142a przez ameryka\\u0144skiego artyst\\u0119 John&#039;a Alexander&#039;a a wykonana w mediola\\u0144skich zak\\u0142adach Bruni Glass. Jej kszta\\u0142t ma nawi\\u0105zywa\\u0107 do archeologicznej zagadki o kryszta\\u0142owych czaszkach.&lt;\\\/span&gt;&lt;\\\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;available_now&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;available_later&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:1026,&quot;id_product&quot;:1026,&quot;out_of_stock&quot;:2,&quot;new&quot;:0,&quot;id_product_attribute&quot;:1138,&quot;quantity_wanted&quot;:1,&quot;extraContent&quot;:[],&quot;allow_oosp&quot;:0,&quot;category&quot;:&quot;wodka&quot;,&quot;category_name&quot;:&quot;W\\u00f3dka&quot;,&quot;link&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/luksusowealkohole.pl\\\/wodka\\\/1026-wodka-crystal-head&quot;,&quot;manufacturer_name&quot;:null,&quot;attribute_price&quot;:0,&quot;price_tax_exc&quot;:268.2926830000000109066604636609554290771484375,&quot;price_without_reduction&quot;:330,&quot;reduction&quot;:0,&quot;specific_prices&quot;:[],&quot;quantity&quot;:0,&quot;quantity_all_versions&quot;:1,&quot;id_image&quot;:&quot;pl-default&quot;,&quot;features&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Kraj&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Kanada&quot;,&quot;id_feature&quot;:3,&quot;position&quot;:2,&quot;id_feature_value&quot;:44},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alkohol&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;40%&quot;,&quot;id_feature&quot;:5,&quot;position&quot;:4,&quot;id_feature_value&quot;:223}],&quot;attachments&quot;:[],&quot;virtual&quot;:0,&quot;pack&quot;:0,&quot;packItems&quot;:[],&quot;nopac